WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.585
We're monsters who help,

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:04.963
and we call ourselves the Helpsters!

00:00:05.047 --> 00:00:06.798
It's a delight to see you,

00:00:06.882 --> 00:00:09.218
but I'm afraid I have a problem.

00:00:09.635 --> 00:00:12.095
Problems are our specialty!

00:00:12.179 --> 00:00:13.764
If there's a way, we'll find it

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.641
Just have to monstermind it

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:17.559
From the makers of Sesame Street.

00:00:17.643 --> 00:00:21.146
Our goal is to teach Wayne a magic trick
so he can become a magician.

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:23.023
We just need a plan.

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:26.193
I believe there's an idea
inside each and every one of you.

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.486
-What's happening?
-What? I don't get it.

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:28.570
He's getting an idea.

00:00:28.654 --> 00:00:31.114
How can we help you?

00:00:31.198 --> 00:00:34.535
'Cause all we wanna do is help you

00:00:34.618 --> 00:00:36.370
For problems big or small...

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:38.247
Let's get this done.

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:39.998
...they're here to help solve them all.

00:00:40.082 --> 00:00:41.750
Everything is under control.

00:00:41.834 --> 00:00:44.336
Everything is out of control!

00:00:44.419 --> 00:00:45.921
Come quick!

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:48.173
High fives and handshakes

00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:50.634
Oh, no. We got it wrong!

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.011
We are Helpsters,
and nobody's giving up,

00:00:53.095 --> 00:00:54.555
not on my watch.

00:00:54.638 --> 00:00:56.640
What a difference a plan makes

00:00:57.558 --> 00:00:59.643
High fives and handshakes

00:01:00.686 --> 00:01:02.604
High fives and handshakes

00:01:02.688 --> 00:01:03.522
Bravo!

00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:04.982
We did it, everyone!

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:07.234
Let the jubilations commence!

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:09.486
-What?
-That means "be happy."

00:01:10.529 --> 00:01:11.572
Helpsters

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:14.908
Watch now on the Apple TV app.

